#: ../../../Proposals/TestSuite.md:5
msgid ""
"These are ideas for additional programs, benchmarks, applications and "
"algorithms that could be added to the LLVM Test-Suite. The test-suite could "
"be much larger than it is now, which would help us detecting compiler errors "
"(crashes, miscompiles) during development."
msgstr ""

